# Root-level sequence files only. Docker matches these with filepath.Match,
# where `*` does not cross a `/`, so these patterns catch `big.fasta` at the
# context root and nothing nested - unlike .gitignore, which would match at any
# depth. Do NOT "fix" them to `**/*.fasta`: that would strip
# workflow/allergens_dataset.fasta out of the image, and stage 6's allergen
# homology screen reads it (screening.allergen_homology in config.yaml). The
# devcontainer would not notice, because it bind-mounts the project over the
# image, but a plain `docker build` + `docker run` would fail in stage 6.
*.fasta
*.fa
*.faa
*.gz
*.zip
